  "completion": "MAINLINE-025 card, both-demand scoring and reusable size/stressed-measure interface completed and filed; sixteen technical qualification gaps retained explicitly.",
  "at": "2026-10-20T01:10:42-07:00",
  "body": "MAINLINE-025 and the 0.82 GPa amendment are complete. The original tube sees 0.824658 GPa equilateral versus 1.428350 GPa inherited mean compression; bow raises extremes to 0.855499/1.487181 GPa, both faces compressive.\n\nNo probability-qualified full-size compression allowable is established. With k=0.2 and the NASA local sensitivity, reoptimized equilateral/inherited pressure multipliers are: SiC Fc380 MPa 0.45120/0.26050; assumed Fc1 GPa 1.16866/0.67954; unqualified Fc3.9 GPa 1.20571/1.07575. Mixed CMC Fc580 MPa gives 0.87116/0.50298. All are QUESTIONABLE/PROJECTION.\n\nallowable.py and ALLOWABLE-INTERFACE.md supply tube-size and stressed-volume/surface functions for 022b, both force rules, and explicit null compression qualification. Tensile Weibull hypotheses are not compression allowables. No public source demonstrates the complete curved 247 mm OD, 0.88 mm wall, 2.04 m product. Film-sag loss remains assigned to 024/022b; the retained mass budget has zero spare lift.\n\nSeventeen model, nine interface and twenty-eight packaging/cross-calculation checks pass; eleven inherited/amendment pins verified. CARD, RESULTS, INPUTS, sixteen-row NFI, source memos, scripts and manifest are pinned. All delegates finished. No successor is named; awaiting robotics dispatch as CARD-025 directs.",
